FLOOR 5 of 9 - THE ENCHANTING TABLE

enchanted_book.txt is written in the language of the enchanting table.
A wizard hid a sentence in it using two spells, one after another:

  1. the sentence was encoded with Base64
  2. the result was written down as a hex dump

Undo the spells in the opposite order to read the sentence.
It tells you the password for locstd05.
